            "block_content": "The Sotection funding in the Alliance reserve will be utilized for the eligible Sotection employees. Upon completion of eligibility, any remaining Sotection funding will be reverted to the Alliance for the exclusive use of Alliance programs on behalf of eligible Lucent employees who are represented by the CWA.",
